[[File:RG 01 (Beta 40.0).png|thumb|Beta 40.0]]
RG 01 and RG 02 do everything together, even changing stats. In RG 01's case, these are HP based, starting at 8, increased to 9 in '''Beta 5.3''' and to 10 in '''Beta 6.5'''.

'''Beta 8.1''' gave RG 01 an ability. Once RG 01 dies, every RG 02 you have on the board gets Taunt. '''Beta 30.0''', with the release of RG 03 and RG 04, expanded its effect to also affect them. '''Beta 40.0''' made its effect able to affect other RG 01's. '''Beta 54.1''' changed it (back) into a [[:Category:Common|Common]], getting replaced by [[Dad Slime]] and [[Gyftrot]] in starter decks. 

